              <p class="text-gar-text-secondary mb-4">
                The daemon listens on a Unix socket for JSON-formatted commands.
              </p>

              <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gar-text-primary mb-3">Socket Location</h4>
              <code class="text-gar-accent-yellow">$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/garshot.sock</code> or <code class="text-gar-accent-yellow">/tmp/garshot.sock</code>

              <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gar-text-primary mb-3 mt-4">Request Types</h4>
              <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-gar-text-muted/20 mb-4">
                <pre class="bg-gar-bg-primary p-4 overflow-x-auto"><code class="text-sm text-gar-text-primary font-mono">{`{"type": "Screen", "monitor": null, "cursor": false}
{"type": "Region", "cursor": false}
{"type": "Window", "id": null, "decorations": false, "cursor": false}
{"type": "ActiveWindow", "decorations": false, "cursor": false}
{"type": "Status"}
{"type": "ListMonitors"}
{"type": "Shutdown"}`}</code></pre>
              </div>

              <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gar-text-primary mb-3">Response Format</h4>
              <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-gar-text-muted/20">
                <pre class="bg-gar-bg-primary p-4 overflow-x-auto"><code class="text-sm text-gar-text-primary font-mono">{`// Success with file path
{"success": true, "path": "/home/user/Pictures/screenshot.png"}

// Success with base64 data (stdout mode)
{"success": true, "data": "iVBORw0KGgo..."}

// Error
{"success": false, "error": "No active window"}`}</code></pre>
              </div>
            </div>

